      "text": "land far northward that had been peopled and destroyed, Alma 22:30–31. place of first landing of people of Zarahemla, Alma 22:30. day and a half journey from east to west sea, Alma 22:32. Moroni1 names land south of Desolation land of liberty, Alma 46:17. Nephites overtake Morianton2 in Desolation, Alma 50:33–34. Hagoth’s ships built near Desolation, Alma 63:5. land appointed for gathering extends to line between Bountiful2 and Desolation, 3 Ne. 3:23. Mormon2 causes people to gather in Desolation, Morm. 3:5. Lamanites possess Desolation, Morm. 4:1–2, 19. near land of Moron, Ether 7:6.",
